        "Payward completed acquisition of Bitnomial and retains third-party clearing operations."
      ],
      "counterpoints": [
        "No XRP collateral volume or market-share data."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "H3",
      "statement": "Coinbase could potentially use the CFTC 26-05 framework for DCO-approved XRP collateral.",
