        "Coinbase Financial Markets originated the request; letter permits DCO-accepted non-security digital assets after conditions."
      ],
      "counterpoints": [
        "No Coinbase notice of reliance or XRP usage located.",
        "No direct Bitnomial clearing relationship verified."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "H4",
      "statement": "RLUSD is currently accepted by Bitnomial.",
